/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 90 0 R
/T (Entry-level competition is intensifying: Handshake recorded 15% fewer job postings and 30% more applications per job for the Class of 2025. Meanwhile, 70% of employers use skills-based hiring, with 87% applying it during interviews. Yet candidates still practise isolated questions, leaving them unprepared for adaptive, multi-round conversations and consistent evaluation.)
/E (Entry-level competition is intensifying: Handshake recorded 15% fewer job postings and 30% more applications per job for the Class of 2025. Meanwhile, 70% of employers use skills-based hiring, with 87% applying it during interviews. Yet candidates still practise isolated questions, leaving them unprepared for adaptive, multi-round conversations and consistent evaluation.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
