168 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 91 0 R
/E (RoundCraft is a practice-only, voice-first interview simulator for candidates across job functions. Users either choose a professionally designed interview loop \(recruiter screen, behavioural, functional, case, hiring-manager or panel round\) or paste a job description to generate the appropriate sequence. They never configure agents. A coordinator assigns each AI interviewer a distinct role, rubric and objective. Through Agora, interviewers conduct natural conversations, interrupt, probe vague claims and hand off unresolved points to later rounds. Shared cross-round memory allows the next interviewer to test contradictions, missing evidence and weak competencies instead of restarting from zero. After the loop, RoundCraft produces independent round scorecards, transcript-linked evidence, an offer-readiness skill map and targeted replay drills. Unlike question banks, single-chatbot mocks or tools that assist during real interviews, RoundCraft recreates the complete interview loop and trains candidates before the real one.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
